# SPA fallback for client-side routing.
#
# TanStack Router uses browser history, so /services/architectural-design is a
# real document request on a cold load. Without this rule the static host looks
# for a matching file, finds none, and returns its own 404 instead of the app
# shell. Vite's dev and preview servers apply this fallback automatically, which
# is why deep links work locally and break only once deployed.
#
# The static catch-all has to come last so real assets still win.
/*    /index.html   200
